interested in following that.

00:49:29.640 --> 00:49:32.560
For me, I don't use
Twitter as a B2B tool,

00:49:32.560 --> 00:49:34.920
but other people do,
so principally, you know,

00:49:34.920 --> 00:49:38.000
something like Twitter is,
it's about consuming

00:49:38.000 --> 00:49:39.640
